  "title": "Mono Light",
  "summary": "A strict grayscale light theme with clean paper-white surfaces and precise tonal hierarchy.",
  "descriptionMarkdown": "Mono Light is the photographic inverse of Mono Dark. Paper-white surfaces, black primary data, and controlled grey snapshots form a calm measurement workspace without relying on hue. Its level meter becomes darker as signals approach the limit, while every analysis view preserves the same shared tonal hierarchy.",
